{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 81,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        127.9406967163086,
        27.289522171020508,
        325.5927734375,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "9. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATION ON USE OF ANTIBIOTICS IN SAM",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0813293457031,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Wilkinson et al. (1996), used a pre-post design to compare mortality rates of 300",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.15289306640625,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "children admitted with SAM in South Africa over two time periods: a 6-month period",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.06292724609375,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "before introduction of a specific antibiotic protocol compared with the following",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.122802734375,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "6-month period, when standardized guidelines for antibiotics and management of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1127624511719,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "hypoglycemia were introduced. The recommended antibiotics were ampicillin (7",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0828857421875,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "days) and gentamicin (5 days). In the pre-protocol period, there were 32 deaths in 162",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.0428466796875,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "admissions (case rate fatality [CFR] 20%). In the post-protocol period, there were 8",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.04266357421875,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "deaths in 138 admissions (CFR 6%). This translates to a risk ratio of 0.25 (95% CI 0.14",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        335.60284423828125,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "to 0.62), or a 75% (95% CI 38-86%) reduction in the risk of mortality.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.06146240234375,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "In a cohort of children with uncomplicated SAM treated at home, Amthor et",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.09271240234375,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "al (2009) retrospectively analyzed the recovery at 12 weeks (Weight for Height > 2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0628967285156,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Standared Deviation and no oedema) between a group treated with oral amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0428161621094,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "for 7 days (n = 514) with a group not receiving antibiotics (n = 1850). The chance",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.11279296875,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "of recovery was 29% (95% CI 7–46%) higher in the group not receiving antibiotics.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.122802734375,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "However, the two studied populations differed, in that children in the antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        330.2029724121094,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "group were more likely to be wasted and less likely to have oedema.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.1514587402344,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "In an open, randomized, controlled trial in a therapeutic feeding centre in Sudan,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.0429382324219,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Dubray et al (2008) compared ceftriaxone (75 mg/kg/day once daily for 2 days) with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.0628967285156,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "oral amoxicillin (80 mg/kg/day, twice daily for 5 days) for uncomplicated malnutrition.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.1028747558594,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Two hundred and thirty (230) children were randomized to the amoxillin group, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.0828552246094,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "228 to the ceftriaxone group. Randomization was adequate, with intention-to-treat",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        399.1028137207031,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "analysis. There was no significant difference between the two groups in weight gain",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.7420959472656,
        399.13275146484375,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(RR 0.96, 95% CI 0.81 to 1.31), recovery rate (RR 0.94, 95% CI 0.84 to 1.05), mortality",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        358.7420959472656,
        399.122802734375,
        372.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(RR 1.27, 95% CI 0.48 to 3.36) or antibiotic-related adverse events (RR 3.9, 95% CI",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        371.7420959472656,
        399.10296630859375,
        385.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "0.85 to 18.5). The cost of treatment with amoxicillin was significantly lower than",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        384.7420959472656,
        284.2828674316406,
        398.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "ceftriaxone (US$ 1.60 versus US$ 0.20 for a 10 kg child).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.2361145019531,
        126.80288696289062,
        418.3760986328125
      ],
      "text": "Indirect evidence",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        422.5657043457031,
        134.7069091796875,
        434.09869384765625
      ],
      "text": "Uncomplicated SAM",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        435.0806884765625,
        399.01275634765625,
        448.5707092285156
      ],
      "text": "There are no data on the prevalence or aetiology of bacteraemia in children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        448.0806884765625,
        399.10284423828125,
        461.5707092285156
      ],
      "text": "‘uncomplicated malnutrition’, and the role of antibiotics for ‘treatment’ of an occult",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        461.0806884765625,
        399.08306884765625,
        474.5707092285156
      ],
      "text": "infection is therefore not clear. SAM in children is a cause of immunosuppression",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        474.0806884765625,
        399.0728454589844,
        487.5707092285156
      ],
      "text": "[Beisel 1996; Chandra 1991; Chandra 1999]. Cotrimoxazole prophylaxis reduces",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        487.0806884765625,
        399.1128234863281,
        500.5707092285156
      ],
      "text": "mortality and morbidity in children with HIV/AIDS and is currently recommended",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        500.0806884765625,
        399.0827941894531,
        513.5706787109375
      ],
      "text": "[WHO 2006]. Cotrimoxazole prophylaxis may have similar benefits in children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        513.0806884765625,
        282.2030029296875,
        526.5706787109375
      ],
      "text": "malnutrition given the associated immunosuppression.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        535.0697021484375,
        125.0359115600586,
        546.6027221679688
      ],
      "text": "Complicated SAM",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        547.584716796875,
        399.09283447265625,
        561.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "There is a high incidence of bacterial infections in children with SAM, with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        560.584716796875,
        399.0927429199219,
        574.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "bacteraemia reported in 9–29% of children (seven studies), UTI in 17–31% (three",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        573.584716796875,
        399.052978515625,
        587.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "studies) and pneumonia in 28%. In 162 severely malnourished children in Tanzania,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        586.584716796875,
        399.122802734375,
        600.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "92% had at least one bacterial infection, and 49% acquired an infection during",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        599.584716796875,
        179.09292602539062,
        613.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "hospitalization [Isaack, 1992].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        612.4547119140625,
        399.1203918457031,
        626.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "pneumococcus staph. aureus Klebsiella Frequently isolated pathogens include  ,  ,  ,",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4654998779297,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.5745086669922,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "67",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}